 "bio": {
  "lang": "en",
  "script": "Latn",
  "text": "Solomon Abebe is a paramount writer, considering you read ኤክሶድያ makes perfect sense. He is best known for writing research based migration fiction. He wrote ኤክሶድያ based on an exploratory research from Jima, Ethiopia to Saudi via Somali land and Yemen. ኤክሶድያ illustrates love and migration without better destination in the life of the characters."
